{"prototypeToken":{"displayName":20,"displayBars":20,"flags":{"pf2e":{"linkToActorSize":true,"autoscale":true}},"height":1,"width":1,"name":"Abandoned","actorLink":false,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/tokens/abandoned.webp","scaleX":2,"scaleY":2,"tint":"#ffffff","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"light":{"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1},"negative":false,"priority":0},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":true,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":2,"texture":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/subjects/abandoned.webp"}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"depth":1},"name":"Abandoned","type":"npc","effects":[],"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":45,"temp":0,"max":45,"details":""},"ac":{"value":17,"details":""},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":25,"otherSpeeds":[],"details":""},"immunities":[{"type":"death-effects","exceptions":[]},{"type":"disease","exceptions":[]},{"type":"paralyzed","exceptions":[]},{"type":"poison","exceptions":[]},{"type":"unconscious","exceptions":[]}],"weaknesses":[{"type":"vitality","value":5,"exceptions":[]},{"type":"slashing","value":5,"exceptions":[]}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":["common"],"details":"can't speak any language"},"level":{"value":2},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>Some people die long before they draw their final breath. Abandoned are undead that felt the bitter sting of isolation in their final days or final moments, watching helplessly as those they loved and trusted left them behind. Their last moments were often filled with a deep shame and a desperate desire for revenge against those who abandoned them.</p>\n<p>At first glance, abandoned appear to be simple zombies, but even casual observation reveals that they move deliberately and intelligently. Abandoned are much stronger than a zombie shambler and have the ability to use tools and plan simple ambushes. In combat, abandoned struggle to land blows against their foes, but they can unleash tears of loneliness and isolation to blind their enemies. After shedding enough tears, their vision clears, and they can unleash their frustration more effectively. When an abandoned is destroyed, they often scream the names of the people who abandoned them with a final rasping breath.</p>\n<h2>A Will to Kill</h2>\n<p>Abandoned prioritize revenge against those who left them behind. They're often found patrolling homes and other locations associated with happier times, reliving memories while sobbing. Should they succeed in their revenge, the guilt of their victims causes them to often rise as zombie shamblers to accompany in death those they failed in life.</p>\n<h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2>\n<p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 5/12/22 gp</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (bludgeoning), armor (light, medium), perception item, skill items (Athletics)</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> acid, constitution, dexterity, energy resistant (negative), evil, mental, negative, poison, strength, throwing, wild</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Strange and Unusual","authors":"Mark T. Adkins","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"creatureType":""},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":4},"dex":{"mod":1},"con":{"mod":4},"int":{"mod":-3},"wis":{"mod":1},"cha":{"mod":-3}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":5,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":11,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":7,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":5,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"athletics":{"base":8}},"traits":{"value":["evil","undead","unholy"],"rarity":"uncommon","size":{"value":"med"}}},"img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/Portraits/abandoned.webp","items":[{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Blinded by Grief","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>An abandoned's eyes are filled with bitter necrotic tears, which slowly leak out, leaving smoking wounds on their cheeks. This mixture hampers the abandoned's vision, causing it to be @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Dazzled]{Dazzled} in most circumstances. Once an abandoned has used Malicious Tears three times in the same 10 minute period, it loses the dazzled condition but also no longer meets the requirements to use Malicious Tears. The dazzled condition returns after 10 minutes, as the creature's decaying tear ducts produce more necrotic tears.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"mEAs4Fo57DUldRU6","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"4.12.6","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1685478615215,"modifiedTime":1685480589913,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"melee","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","name":"Fist","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":[],"otherTags":[]},"damageRolls":{"luBXtUuyj69eu80O":{"damage":"1d10+4","damageType":"bludgeoning","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":12},"attackEffects":{"value":["grab"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}}},"effects":[],"_id":"s1YQM9sROrr1fB4w","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"4.12.6","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1685478763124,"modifiedTime":1685479478442,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Retributive Torrent","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The abandoned is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Dazzled]{Dazzled} by its necrotic tears</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The abandoned takes slashing damage from a creature within 15 feet</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The abandoned uses Malicious Tears; the cone must include the triggering creature.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"DnOrrPOiucdBBi12","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"4.12.6","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1685478766714,"modifiedTime":1685478796831,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Sorrow of Isolation","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>20 feet. The weight of isolation hangs around an abandoned, and enemies who draw too close can be overwhelmed by the emotion. Any enemy that enters the aura must attempt a @Check[type:will|dc:15] save, with the following effects.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature can't assist its allies for 1 minute. It no longer grants flanking and can't Aid its allies.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, and the creature becomes so desperate to restore its sense of companionship that it encroaches on its allies' personal space. On its turn, if the creature isn't adjacent to an ally, it must move until it's adjacent to an ally before taking any other actions.</p>"},"rules":[{"key":"Aura","radius":20,"traits":["emotion","mental"]}],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["aura","emotion","mental"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"efBWHPI9hzPYZFp5","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"4.12.6","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1685478803850,"modifiedTime":1685480605008,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","name":"Grab","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary